{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019013311947-1019_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261019092338\"/><p>行動中檢獲懷疑可卡因。</p><p>紅磡截獲毒品快餐車。今日(19日)凌晨1時許，警員於大環道巡邏期間，發現一輛停泊私家車的司機神色有異，遂上前截查。調查期間，人員在車內發現約20包懷疑可卡因，遂再召緝毒犬到場協助搜查。經初步調查，該名年約20歲男司機涉嫌「販運危險藥物」被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T01:39:15.855905+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T17:33:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T02:37:49.641711+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T01:37:49.047409+00:00","content_hash":"56e53e714d2f308029113f718c7617a5f0c82fc62ca5b6577584397af19c2b47","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}